    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $json.message.chat.id }}",
        "text": "={{\n`<b>📚 Welcome to BookScout!</b>\n\nI can help you discover books in multiple ways.\n\n<b>🔍 Commands</b>\n\n<code>/search</code>\n<code>/recommend</code>\n<code>/help</code>\n\n<b>📸 Scan a Book</b>\n\nSimply send a book cover photo and I'll identify it.\n\n<b>💬 Chat Naturally</b>\n\n• Tell me about Dune\n• Recommend mystery novels\n• I loved Harry Potter. What should I read next?\n\nHappy Reading! 📖`\n}}",
